Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.75,0:00:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's head back to the campsite.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.50,0:00:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.80,0:00:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Heave-ho.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.40,0:00:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stop doing this in public!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.80,0:00:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Why? \NAre you embarrassed to be seen by Aoi?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll explain it to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.40,0:00:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Satoko has a weak constitution.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.40,0:00:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to strain her as much as possible, \Nso I'm carrying her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.05,0:00:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I can walk back on my own!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.58,0:00:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You've pushed yourself way too hard today, \Nso it's better if you don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.70,0:00:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Aoi, is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.60,0:00:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No, it's nothing at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.60,0:00:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.66,0:01:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,May things go well for these two.
